    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>Auto-configuration</code></a> for Spring Security in a reactive\napplication. Switches on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/config/annotation/web/reactive/EnableWebFluxSecurity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.config.annotation.web.reactive\"><code>@EnableWebFluxSecurity</code></a> for a\nreactive web application if this annotation has not been added by the user. It\ndelegates to Spring Security's content-negotiation mechanism for authentication. This\nconfiguration also backs off if a bean of type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/server/WebFilterChainProxy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.server\"><code>WebFilterChainProxy</code></a> has been\nconfigured in any other way.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>自动配置</code></a> 用于响应式应用程序中的 Spring Security。如果用户未添加此注解，则针对响应式 Web 应用程序启用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/config/annotation/web/reactive/EnableWebFluxSecurity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.config.annotation.web.reactive\"><code>@EnableWebFluxSecurity</code></a>。此配置委托给 Spring Security 的内容协商机制进行身份验证。如果已以任何其他方式配置了类型为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/server/WebFilterChainProxy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.server\"><code>WebFilterChainProxy</code></a> 的 Bean，此配置也会回退。",
      "count": 2
